            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://{account}.leankit.com/io/card"
          },
          "docs": "Delete multiple cards. All cards must be on the same board. The board setting \"Allow users to delete cards\" must be checked, unless the user is a board adminstrator. Example Request"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Assign or unassign one or more users or teams to cards",
